Based on the deploy log, there were issues with the health checks in the eu-west-1 region where the 5xx rate was 19%, which is over the threshold of 1%. The rollout was halted in this region.

The release appears mostly stable in us-east-1 and eu-central-1. Given this, I will file the release record with the status indicating a partial success and a summary mentioning the issue in eu-west-1.

CALL release_notes {"status": "Partial Success", "summary": "Auth-broker@6.24.8-c0bd0a rolled out successfully to us-east-1 and eu-central-1, but encountered a health check failure with a 5xx rate of 19% in eu-west-1, causing the rollout to halt in that region."}

